                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "There are a number of benefits to publishing Open Access, and many \nresearchers want to contribute to the Open Science movement by the means\n of Open Access publishing. However, researchers still come across \nbarriers when wanting to make their work Open Access. In this session, \nyou will learn about the different types of Open Access and the options \navailable to you to publish Open Access at the EUR so that you can \novercome potential barriers to make your work publicly available."
                }
              }
